# 源代码统一使用 LF 换行
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：禁止换行转换（Windows 上 Git 可能把不含 NUL 字节的小 PDF 当成文本而破坏它）
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.webp binary
*.heic binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
